OL,3,GNEWSAMan says GP refused repeat
OL,4,Apainkiller prescription
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincolnshire man who suffers from
OL,7,Finfrequent but severe gall bladder pain
OL,8,Fsays he can no longer obtain medication
OL,9,Fhe relies on during flare-ups after his
OL,10,FGP practice refused to issue a repeat
OL,11,Fprescription.
OL,13,FPaul Sutton, 65, from the Mablethorpe
OL,14,Farea, was prescribed the painkiller
OL,15,Fco-dydramol in hospital, but when his
OL,16,Fpacket of tablets expired he says his
OL,17,FGP practice refused to prescribe any
OL,18,Fmore.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
