OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan says GP refused repeat
OL,4,Apainkiller prescription
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Lincolnshire Integrated Care Board
OL,7,F(ICB) said co-dydramol is on its
OL,8,F"red-red" list and is not recommended
OL,9,Ffor routine prescribing.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for Marisco Medical
OL,12,FPractice said it could not comment on
OL,13,Fan individual patient's care, but said
OL,14,Fthe practice follows local prescribing
OL,15,Fguidance.
